@end multitable

@item vidstudio_add_clip
Append a clip to TRACK. KIND: video|image (PATH), solid (R G B), text (TEXT). DURATION_FRAMES at project fps. Video clips decode on a worker thread (see vidstudio_info's 'decoding' marker).

@itemize @bullet
@item CLI: @command{emacsctl tool vidstudio add-clip}
@item Surfaces: mcp, dbus, cli, menu, agents
@item Returns: string
