@multitable @columnfractions .2 .12 .1 .58
@headitem Argument @tab Type @tab Required @tab Description
@item @code{handle} @tab integer @tab yes @tab Project handle
@item @code{track} @tab integer @tab yes @tab Track index
@item @code{kind} @tab string @tab yes @tab video, image, solid or text
@item @code{path} @tab string @tab no @tab Media file, for a video or image clip
@item @code{text} @tab string @tab no @tab The text, for a text clip
@item @code{duration_frames} @tab integer @tab no @tab Length in frames (default 90)
@item @code{r} @tab integer @tab no @tab Red 0-255, for a solid clip (default 128)
@item @code{g} @tab integer @tab no @tab Green 0-255, for a solid clip (default 128)
@item @code{b} @tab integer @tab no @tab Blue 0-255, for a solid clip (default 128)
