@item vidstudio_add_effect
Append an effect to CLIP. TYPE: 0 blur,1 bloom,2 color-grade,3 vignette,4 grain.

@itemize @bullet
@item CLI: @command{emacsctl tool vidstudio add-effect}
@item Surfaces: mcp, dbus, cli, menu, agents
@item Returns: string
@item Example: @code{emacsctl tool vidstudio add-effect --handle 1 --clip 2 --type 3}
